<h1>About TradeAutoX</h1>

<p>TradeAutoX was founded in 2018 by Louis Spaeth and Michael Zimmerman, two Atlanta dealership
desk managers who wanted a simpler way for dealers to trade vehicles with each other — directly,
without the auction fees.</p>

<p>TradeAutoX is a dealer-to-dealer wholesale marketplace for licensed dealers. Membership is one
flat $599/month, with unlimited buying and selling and no auction fees. Your first 30 days are free.</p>

<p>More of our story is coming soon.</p>

